      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, the following code applies a gamma of `2.0` to a one-pixel pixel buffer:",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, the following code applies a gamma of `2.0` to a one-pixel pixel buffer:",
      "sourceHash": "eb2f49b804725f64c9514272b685033d692e8ae84490881d4eef5b4a7b62ec8b",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "For the best performance, pass an existing [`vImage.InterleavedFx2`](vimage/interleavedfx2.md) buffer to `intermediateBuffer`, alternatively, pass ``nil`` to specify that the function creates the intermediate buffer.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet buffer = vImage.PixelBuffer<vImage.Interleaved8x2>(\n    pixelValues: [64, 128],\n    size: vImage.Size(width: 1,\n                      height: 1))\n\nbuffer.applyGamma(.fullPrecision(2),\n                  destination: buffer)\n\n// Prints \"[16, 64]\" ≅ [255 * 0.25², 255 * 0.5²].\nprint(buffer.array)\n```",
      "documentTitle": "applyGamma(:intermediateBuffer:destination:)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
